- title: Build the general-shape residual block
- difficulty_1_to_5: 4
- description: Implement a correctness-first complete block using two tiled convolution stages and materialized GroupNorm boundaries, while fusing each normalization transform with SiLU and fusing the final transform with the residual add.
- expected_vs_baseline_factor: 0.95x
- rationale: This directly respects both whole-group dependencies, supports arbitrary B/H/W, and removes standalone affine, SiLU, and residual kernels without depending on compact-map residency.

